.TH UBUNTU-BUILDER 1 "November 2026" "ubuntu-builder 3.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ubuntu-builder \- build your own Ubuntu based distribution
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ubuntu-builder
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ubuntu-builder
opens the graphical remastering tool. Select an ISO (a local file or an
official image downloaded from ubuntu.com), customize it with the Console,
Synaptic, the nested Desktop, the Wizard and the Distribution settings, then
build a hybrid ISO that boots on legacy BIOS and on UEFI with Secure Boot.
.PP
The application runs as the desktop user and asks for administrator rights
through
.BR pkexec (1)
only for extracting, chroot sessions and building.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/ubuntu-builder-workspace
Default workspace: extracted ISO tree, unpacked file system, downloads.
.TP
.I ~/.config/ubuntu-builder/ubuntu-builder.conf
Settings.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ubuntu-builder-cli (1)
